From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eric Reinsmidt <735251+ericreinsmidt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:46:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Kernel trim, stage 3, for size: U-Boot reads the Image from
 the card at about 17 MB/s, so each MB is about 60 ms of the boot. Out: the
 display engine's smart backlight (a 720 KB table nothing asks for), USB audio
 (no USB host in this kernel), IPsec, traffic control, FUSE, squashfs,
 overlayfs and ext2 (ext4 mounts it), and every codepage but 437, ISO 8859-1
 and UTF-8. Bluetooth, cfg80211 and mac80211 become modules, ready for Wi-Fi
 and Bluetooth. The Image is 8.70 MB where it was 10.24, read 64 ms sooner;
 the list with sizes is in brick-spike/trim/stage3.txt

---
 arch/arm64/configs/brick_defconfig | 47 ++++++++++++------------------
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

